IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FIXTURE-BASE.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT INFILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUTFILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD INFILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 IN-SIGNED PIC S9(2)V9(2) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
05 IN-TEXT PIC X(3).
FD OUTFILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-NUM PIC 9(2).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 WORK-NUM PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 TEXT-VAL PIC X(3) VALUE "ABC".
01 PACKED PIC S9(3)V9(2) COMP-3 VALUE -1.25.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
DISPLAY PACKED
STOP RUN.
